        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Dear Mariah,<div><br></div><div>Thanks for reaching out.</div><div><br></div><div>Here is the value for each reason:<br><br><div>\n<div style=\"color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\">\n<div>UNKNOWN = -1</div>\n<div>SKIPPED = 1</div>\n<div>QUESTION_CRITERIA = 2</div>\n<div>SECTION_CRITERIA = 3</div>\n<div>QUESTION_RANDOMIZATION = 4</div>\n<div>SECTION_RANDOMIZATION = 5</div>\n<div>DISABLED_QUESTION = 6</div>\n<div>NO_SECTION_LOOP = 7</div>\n<div>SECTIONS_FLOW = 8</div>\n<div>SESSION_STATUS = 9</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><br></div>\n<div>Please do not hesitate to contact us for any further requirements.</div>\n</div>\n<div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"2\">\n<div>\n<br>Best regards,<br><span style=\"color:var(--text-normal);\">Milad<br></span><br>\n</div>\n<div>Note: If you feel like your issue is not properly being addressed and want to escalate it, please click here: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25443/c57c08c1304c5c33\" title=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25443/c57c08c1304c5c33\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com/app/public/zammad/escalate/25443/c57c08c1304c5c33</a><br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: support@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><br>\n</div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Wednesday, October 2, 2024 at 10:53:40 PM, Mariahellen Dimalaluan wrote:<br><br><div>Good afternoon,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>What do the unanswered_status_id numbers stand for? I can't find the coding guide for it.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Is there a copy of all potential metadata fields and what the numbers correspond to that I can have?</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Thanks so much,</div>\n<div>Mariah</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div>\n<div><br></div>Dear Mariah,<div><br></div>\n<div><br></div>\n<br><br>\n</div>",
